  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving delivery of animal health services and disease surveillance in Anbar, Ninawa and Duhok</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the risk of international movement of animal diseases whose introduction and spread could threaten livestock production, food security and nutrition, food safety and health and the environment of Iraq. Further to that, the expected outcome of the project is to strengthen capacity of veterinary services to detect, diagnose and report highly pathogenic animal diseases and improve communication between central/local levels and herding communities.</narrative>
  </description>
